    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 11
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Permisi, Pak. Bapak jualan hasil foto fauna ya di sini?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: Eh iya, Saya menjual cetakan foto fauna endemik dan pemandangan Sawinggrai
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: Yang fungsinya untuk kenang-kenangan wisatawan
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: Tapi aduh... Hari ini stok foto yang paling dicari wisatawan malah habis
        total
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[4]'
      value: Foto apa ya Pak?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[5]'
      value: Foto Burung Cendrawasih Merah, Biasanya jam-jam segini burungnya suka
        nongkrong di dahan pohon sana.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[6]'
      value: Tapi kaki saya sedang terkilir, jadi sedang kesulitan jalan ke dalam
        hutan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[7]'
      value: Bisa tolong bantu saya ambilkan satu foto Burung Cendrawasih di dahan
        itu?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[8]'
      value: Boleh pak, kebetulan saya bawa kamera
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[9]'
      value: Terima kasih banyak! Ingat ya
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[10]'
      value: Jalannya harus pelan-pelan supaya burungnya tidak kaget dan melarikan
        diri
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
