      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Pak, umpannya sudah saya tebarkan di bawah! Ikannya langsung ramai sekali
        berkumpul
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: Hahaha, mantap! Terima kasih banyak ya
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: Ikan-ikan di sini memang sudah terbiasa hidup berdampingan dengan warga
        desa
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: Nah, kalau kamu mau lanjut jalan-jalan, coba deh naik ke jalur hutan
        di sebelah sana.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[4]'
      value: Dengar-dengar ada yang lagi cari foto Burung Cendrawasih.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[5]'
      value: Iya pak
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[6]'
      value: Mau coba lihat mereka dari dekat? Kamu bisa tebarin umpan-umpan ke ikan
        bawah sini
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[7]'
      value: Wah, boleh banget tuh pak!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3861689419981878179, guid: 6b1d1205fca65b54f80052f8b622d4d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[8]'
      value: Ini umpannya
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
